@startuml state-exception-ticket
title State Diagram(Exception Ticket Lifecycle)
!pragma layout smetana

' Source: CR-006, ERD.md and backend-state-machines.md.

state "open" as Open
state "processing" as Processing
state "resolved" as Resolved

[*] --> Open : create exception ticket
Open --> Processing : start processing
Processing --> Resolved : resolve ticket
Open --> Resolved : resolve directly
Resolved --> [*]

note right of Open
  The ticket is linked to a parcel, but it is not a Parcel.status.
end note

@enduml
